    "description": "Don\u2019t miss this hidden gem on the border of Mission Terrace and Crocker Amazon. This inviting single-family home features 3 bedrooms, a split bath on the main level, and a bonus room off the primary bedroom, perfect for a nursery, home office, or creative retreat with direct access to the flat backyard. The original dining room has been thoughtfully converted into a third bedroom, with a dedicated dining alcove near the entry offering space for formal meals. The spacious living room showcases a classic fireplace and five bay windows that fill the space with natural light. The large, original kitchen includes a charming eat-in alcove and opens to a small enclosed patio, ideal for morning coffee or added storage. While the home is carpeted throughout, original hardwood floors lie beneath, ready to be uncovered and refinished. The interior has been freshly painted, and the exterior was completed approximately two years ago. A generous two-car tandem garage provides ample parking, storage, and laundry hookups.A separate 2-bedroom apartment offers versatility for extended family, guests,or rental income. Located just minutes from Balboa Park BART, MUNI, shops, and restaurants, this home offers convenience, character, and potential"
  },
